function addSpanBars(items,a,b){let cal=$('calendar'),first=new Date(y,m,1).getDay(),days=new Date(y,m+1,0).getDate(),cells=[...cal.children];let head=cells.slice(0,7),body=cells.slice(7);while(body.length%7){let el=document.createElement('div');el.className='emptyday';body.push(el)}cal.replaceChildren(...head);for(let row=0;row<body.length/7;row++){let week=document.createElement('div');week.className='monthweek';let nodes=body.slice(row*7,row*7+7);week.append(...nodes);let start=shiftDate(a,row*7-first),end=shiftDate(start,6);let multi=items.filter(e=>e.start!==e.end&&overlaps(e,start,end)&&overlaps(e,a,b));if(multi.length){let lanes=document.createElement('div');lanes.className='spanlanes';for(let e of multi){let lo=Array.from({length:7},(_,i)=>shiftDate(start,i)).findIndex(d=>d>=e.start&&d>=a),hi=Array.from({length:7},(_,i)=>shiftDate(start,i)).findLastIndex(d=>d<=e.end&&d<=b);if(lo<0||hi<lo)continue;let bar=document.createElement('button');bar.className='spanbar';bar.style.gridColumn=`${lo+1}/${hi+2}`;bar.style.setProperty('--cat',color(e));bar.dataset.event=e.__backendId;bar.textContent=e.title;bar.title=e.title;bar.setAttribute('aria-label',e.title+' '+dateText(e));lanes.append(bar)}week.append(lanes)}cal.append(week)}}

